## 13.1 Core Rule

Room Database is the Single Source of Truth.

Every Create, Update, Delete and Progress operation must be persisted locally.

UI observes database-backed Flows.

Internet connectivity must not be required for:

- Project Management.
- Task Management.
- Checklists.
- Comments.
- Progress.
- Notes.
- Calendar.
- Analytics.
- Search.
- Local Backup.
- Local Restore.

## 13.2 Offline Requirements

- App launches without Internet.
- No forced login.
- No network dependency for core operations.
- All local changes are retained.
- App process recreation does not lose saved work.
- Offline error handling is clear.
- No silent data loss.

